In terms of innovation strategy, we will adopt an iterative approach, working closely with the client to refine our solution through corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design, and evaluation loops. This collaborative approach will ensure that our solution meets the client's evolving needs and priorities, while also addressing any technical or regulatory constraints.

